  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus Has Risen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the Sabbath, at dawn on the first day of the week, Mary Magdalene and the other Mary went to look at the tomb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was a violent earthquake, for an angel of the Lord came down from heaven and, going to the tomb, rolled back the stone and sat on it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His appearance was like lightning, and his clothes were white as snow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The guards were so afraid of him that they shook and became like dead men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel said to the women, \"Do not be afraid, for I know that you are looking for Jesus, who was crucified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is not here; he has risen, just as he said. Come and see the place where he lay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then go quickly and tell his disciples: 'He has risen from the dead and is going ahead of you into Galilee. There you will see him.' Now I have told you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the women hurried away from the tomb, afraid yet filled with joy, and ran to tell his disciples.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suddenly Jesus met them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Greetings,\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.28.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he said. They came to him, clasped his feet and worshiped him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus said to them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Do not be afraid. Go and tell my brothers to go to Galilee; there they will see me.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.28.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Guards' Report",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While the women were on their way, some of the guards went into the city and reported to the chief priests everything that had happened.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the chief priests had met with the elders and devised a plan, they gave the soldiers a large sum of money,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "telling them, \"You are to say, 'His disciples came during the night and stole him away while we were asleep.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If this report gets to the governor, we will satisfy him and keep you out of trouble.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the soldiers took the money and did as they were instructed. And this story has been widely circulated among the Jews to this very day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Great Commission",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the eleven disciples went to Galilee, to the mountain where Jesus had told them to go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they saw him, they worshiped him; but some doubted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus came to them and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"All authority in heaven and on earth has been given to me.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.28.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Therefore go and make disciples of all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit,",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.28.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and teaching them to obey everything I have commanded you. And surely I am with you always, to the very end of the age.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MAT.28.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
